  ],
  "duration_s": 515.437007,
  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "上集，咱们盘了，第十到第六，兽首走散了。一百六十多年罗汉被拆散到五六个国家。帝后礼佛图只剩两个窟窿。皇宫井刻时所在日本皇宫丧乱铁一千年只回来过一次。好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了，有人说女史征图呢？东皇经卷哪，昭陵六郡哪。别急，今天这集就是第五到第一一件比一件揪心。最后那个你可能都不知道它长什么样。老规矩，开讲之前，麻烦您扣个一点个红心，让我看看都是谁在听刻五名昭陵六郡。唐太宗李世民死了以后，埋在了昭陵陵前，祭坛上，立着六块浮雕，刻的是他生前骑过的六匹战马、飒禄子全矛杆，白天提屋、特勒芳、清池、石伐赤，每一批都有名字都有故事。一九一四年，古董商卢钦斋把飒禄子和全谋干偷运到了美国，卖给了宾夕法尼亚大学博物馆十二万五千美元，剩下的四郡留在了西安。碑林博物馆六匹马两批在美国四批在中国，他们分开一百多年了，您去西安看思郡，再去费城，看两郡，中间隔着半个地球。您说这是保护还是拆散？第四名，东皇藏经洞文物？一九零零年，敦煌莫高窟的道士王元自无意中打开了一个封闭了近千年的洞窟，里面堆满了从南北朝到北宋的写经文书。捐画密密麻麻好几万卷。可接下来发生的事，是全中国最痛的一段。一九零七年，英国人斯坦因来了，用极少银元骗走了二十四箱血本，五相捐画一万多件，全部运回了伦敦。大英博物馆。现藏敦煌文物约一万三千七百件，是世界上收藏敦煌文物最多的地方。十个月后，法国人伯希河又来了，用五百两银子带走了七千卷精品中的精品。后来日本人来了，俄国人也来了，藏经洞里几万卷文书，就这样一箱一箱被搬空了。您说这是学术考察还是搬家？第三名要遍天目茶碗。南宋时期，福建建阳窑烧出了一种黑釉茶碗，碗里面在特定光线下会浮现出深蓝色的光斑，像宇宙，像星空，日本人管他叫要变，说碗里藏着一片宇宙。这种茶碗，全世界保存完好的只有三件，全在日本东京晋家堂文库、一建、京都大德寺、龙光苑、一建、大阪藤田美术馆，一件三件，都是日本国宝，其中敬家堂的那一件，被称为天下第一晚万中宇宙三件国宝级的中国茶碗，一件都没回来。您说这是收藏还是占友？第二名，女史贞图，东晋顾恺之画的原作早就没了，现存的唐代模本，是大英博物馆的镇馆之宝。一九零零年，八国联军侵华，一个英国上尉从北京把他带走了。一九零三年，大英博物馆只花了二十五英镑就买下了它。更让人心疼的是，后来大英博物馆的修画师不懂中国手绢怎么装裱。按照日本屏风化的办法，把这幅一千多年前的古画硬生生切成了好几段，装在了木板上。您想想，一副完整的手卷被裁成三段，贴在三块板子上，旁边还打了钉子，一幅千年古画被剪碎了裱起来。这事您上哪说理去，您听出来了没有？这五件文物没有一件是光靠值钱出名的昭陵六郡靠的是六匹马分。在两国东皇经眷，靠的是一箱一箱被搬走。要变天幕，靠的是三件国宝，全在日本女史贞图，靠的是被切碎装扮，每一件文物的厉害之处，不在于它值多少银子，在它回不了家。我最近翻了一本书，叫人一生要看的。一百个博物馆里头精选了全球一百个顶级博物馆，每个馆里有什么？中国文物哪一年出去的？现在摆在哪个展厅写的清清楚楚。大英博物馆两万三千多件，法国集美两万多件，美国大都会三万多件。咱们上级下集讲的这些书里都有，您可以带着孩子一页一页翻翻到哪儿。讲到哪告诉他这件是咱们的那件也是咱们的，他们是怎么离开家的，将来要靠谁接回来。什么叫爱国？爱国不是喊出来的，是让孩子知道自己从哪儿来，家里丢过什么，以后要争回什么。这本书放在主页橱窗了，点开头像就能看到中老年朋友看这种书最合适。图多四大不费眼睛放床头，放茶几，随手翻一页就是一段历史。第一名。敦煌莫高窟壁画前面说的藏经洞抢走的是经卷和卷画可，还有一样东西比经卷更让人心疼，是画在墙上的画。莫高窟的壁画总面积四万五千多平方米，从十六国到元代画了一千多年。可一百多年前，西方探险家来了，用特制的胶布贴在墙上，把壁画一块一块粘下来，运出境。现在大英博物馆、法国集美博物馆、俄罗斯埃尔米塔什博物馆、日本、美国到处都有敦煌壁画，有的被切成方块，有的被拼成整墙，有的整面墙被剥走。您想想，敦煌的墙是连着的画，是连着画的一个故事，从这面墙画到那面墙，现在被切开了一半，在伦敦，一半儿在巴黎，一半在圣彼得堡丢了，还能找回来墙上被剥走的画，怎么拼回去？您可以归还一件完整的文物，但你怎么归还一面墙，怎么归还一面被切成十几块，散落在四个国家的墙，这才是中国流失文物最大的痛。不是某一件东西丢了，是某一件东西被撕碎了。圆明园被烧是一八六零年的事，到今天一百六十多年了，一百六十多年里有些文物回来了，兽首回来了，永乐大典回来过，可还有更多的。在伦敦的玻璃柜里，巴黎的库房里，东京的展厅里，某个英国乡下庄园的阁楼上，他们不会说话，但如果他们会说话，一百六十多年，他们只会说两个字，回家。你觉得哪一件文物的故事最让你心疼？是被切成三段装版的女史真图，还是那三件全在日本的药变天。木茶碗评论区聊聊，我等你。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00001",
      "start_ms": 190,
      "end_ms": 710,
      "text": "上集，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00002",
      "start_ms": 710,
      "end_ms": 1390,
      "text": "咱们盘了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00003",
      "start_ms": 1390,
      "end_ms": 3110,
      "text": "第十到第六，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00004",
      "start_ms": 3770,
      "end_ms": 4990,
      "text": "兽首走散了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00005",
      "start_ms": 4990,
      "end_ms": 9110,
      "text": "一百六十多年罗汉被拆散到五六个国家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00006",
      "start_ms": 9770,
      "end_ms": 12770,
      "text": "帝后礼佛图只剩两个窟窿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00007",
      "start_ms": 13310,
      "end_ms": 18690,
      "text": "皇宫井刻时所在日本皇宫丧乱铁一千年只回来过一次。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00008",
      "start_ms": 19130,
      "end_ms": 21450,
      "text": "好多朋友看完在评论区炒翻了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00009",
      "start_ms": 21930,
      "end_ms": 24210,
      "text": "有人说女史征图呢？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24830,
      "end_ms": 26130,
      "text": "东皇经卷哪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00011",
      "start_ms": 26250,
      "end_ms": 27450,
      "text": "昭陵六郡哪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00012",
      "start_ms": 28210,
      "end_ms": 28710,
      "text": "别急，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00013",
      "start_ms": 29230,
      "end_ms": 33340,
      "text": "今天这集就是第五到第一一件比一件揪心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00014",
      "start_ms": 34340,
      "end_ms": 37280,
      "text": "最后那个你可能都不知道它长什么样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00015",
      "start_ms": 37380,
      "end_ms": 38000,
      "text": "老规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00016",
      "start_ms": 38160,
      "end_ms": 38960,
      "text": "开讲之前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00017",
      "start_ms": 39180,
      "end_ms": 41240,
      "text": "麻烦您扣个一点个红心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00018",
      "start_ms": 41580,
      "end_ms": 46080,
      "text": "让我看看都是谁在听刻五名昭陵六郡。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00019",
      "start_ms": 46580,
      "end_ms": 48480,
      "text": "唐太宗李世民死了以后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00020",
      "start_ms": 48680,
      "end_ms": 50520,
      "text": "埋在了昭陵陵前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00021",
      "start_ms": 50560,
      "end_ms": 51220,
      "text": "祭坛上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00022",
      "start_ms": 51400,
      "end_ms": 52720,
      "text": "立着六块浮雕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00023",
      "start_ms": 53200,
      "end_ms": 58560,
      "text": "刻的是他生前骑过的六匹战马、飒禄子全矛杆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00024",
      "start_ms": 58560,
      "end_ms": 64725,
      "text": "白天提屋、特勒芳、清池、石伐赤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00025",
      "start_ms": 65100,
      "end_ms": 67615,
      "text": "每一批都有名字都有故事。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00026",
      "start_ms": 68280,
      "end_ms": 69325,
      "text": "一九一四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00027",
      "start_ms": 69780,
      "end_ms": 75095,
      "text": "古董商卢钦斋把飒禄子和全谋干偷运到了美国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00028",
      "start_ms": 75620,
      "end_ms": 79395,
      "text": "卖给了宾夕法尼亚大学博物馆十二万五千美元，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00029",
      "start_ms": 80330,
      "end_ms": 82490,
      "text": "剩下的四郡留在了西安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00030",
      "start_ms": 82490,
      "end_ms": 87805,
      "text": "碑林博物馆六匹马两批在美国四批在中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00031",
      "start_ms": 88510,
      "end_ms": 90065,
      "text": "他们分开一百多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00032",
      "start_ms": 91540,
      "end_ms": 92965,
      "text": "您去西安看思郡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00033",
      "start_ms": 93420,
      "end_ms": 94480,
      "text": "再去费城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00034",
      "start_ms": 94480,
      "end_ms": 95095,
      "text": "看两郡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00035",
      "start_ms": 95520,
      "end_ms": 97095,
      "text": "中间隔着半个地球。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00036",
      "start_ms": 97500,
      "end_ms": 99915,
      "text": "您说这是保护还是拆散？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00037",
      "start_ms": 100780,
      "end_ms": 101355,
      "text": "第四名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00038",
      "start_ms": 101880,
      "end_ms": 103885,
      "text": "东皇藏经洞文物？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00039",
      "start_ms": 104470,
      "end_ms": 105515,
      "text": "一九零零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00040",
      "start_ms": 105850,
      "end_ms": 113275,
      "text": "敦煌莫高窟的道士王元自无意中打开了一个封闭了近千年的洞窟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00041",
      "start_ms": 114180,
      "end_ms": 119140,
      "text": "里面堆满了从南北朝到北宋的写经文书。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00042",
      "start_ms": 119300,
      "end_ms": 122385,
      "text": "捐画密密麻麻好几万卷。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00043",
      "start_ms": 123050,
      "end_ms": 124715,
      "text": "可接下来发生的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00044",
      "start_ms": 125050,
      "end_ms": 127425,
      "text": "是全中国最痛的一段。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00045",
      "start_ms": 128030,
      "end_ms": 129045,
      "text": "一九零七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00046",
      "start_ms": 129590,
      "end_ms": 131375,
      "text": "英国人斯坦因来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00047",
      "start_ms": 131830,
      "end_ms": 135585,
      "text": "用极少银元骗走了二十四箱血本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00048",
      "start_ms": 136070,
      "end_ms": 138865,
      "text": "五相捐画一万多件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00049",
      "start_ms": 139540,
      "end_ms": 141195,
      "text": "全部运回了伦敦。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00050",
      "start_ms": 142110,
      "end_ms": 143010,
      "text": "大英博物馆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00051",
      "start_ms": 143230,
      "end_ms": 147615,
      "text": "现藏敦煌文物约一万三千七百件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00052",
      "start_ms": 148160,
      "end_ms": 151565,
      "text": "是世界上收藏敦煌文物最多的地方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00053",
      "start_ms": 152130,
      "end_ms": 152865,
      "text": "十个月后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00054",
      "start_ms": 153200,
      "end_ms": 154805,
      "text": "法国人伯希河又来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00055",
      "start_ms": 155360,
      "end_ms": 159915,
      "text": "用五百两银子带走了七千卷精品中的精品。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00056",
      "start_ms": 160160,
      "end_ms": 161245,
      "text": "后来日本人来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00057",
      "start_ms": 161570,
      "end_ms": 162530,
      "text": "俄国人也来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00058",
      "start_ms": 162790,
      "end_ms": 164825,
      "text": "藏经洞里几万卷文书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00059",
      "start_ms": 165490,
      "end_ms": 168125,
      "text": "就这样一箱一箱被搬空了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00060",
      "start_ms": 169040,
      "end_ms": 172005,
      "text": "您说这是学术考察还是搬家？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00061",
      "start_ms": 172550,
      "end_ms": 175215,
      "text": "第三名要遍天目茶碗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00062",
      "start_ms": 175580,
      "end_ms": 176565,
      "text": "南宋时期，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00063",
      "start_ms": 176980,
      "end_ms": 180385,
      "text": "福建建阳窑烧出了一种黑釉茶碗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00064",
      "start_ms": 180910,
      "end_ms": 185695,
      "text": "碗里面在特定光线下会浮现出深蓝色的光斑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00065",
      "start_ms": 186280,
      "end_ms": 186965,
      "text": "像宇宙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00066",
      "start_ms": 187290,
      "end_ms": 187975,
      "text": "像星空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00067",
      "start_ms": 188750,
      "end_ms": 190445,
      "text": "日本人管他叫要变，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00068",
      "start_ms": 190920,
      "end_ms": 193035,
      "text": "说碗里藏着一片宇宙。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00069",
      "start_ms": 193890,
      "end_ms": 194745,
      "text": "这种茶碗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00070",
      "start_ms": 195070,
      "end_ms": 197990,
      "text": "全世界保存完好的只有三件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00071",
      "start_ms": 198210,
      "end_ms": 206440,
      "text": "全在日本东京晋家堂文库、一建、京都大德寺、龙光苑、一建、大阪藤田美术馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00072",
      "start_ms": 206440,
      "end_ms": 208000,
      "text": "一件三件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00073",
      "start_ms": 208040,
      "end_ms": 209255,
      "text": "都是日本国宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00074",
      "start_ms": 209620,
      "end_ms": 211335,
      "text": "其中敬家堂的那一件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00075",
      "start_ms": 211890,
      "end_ms": 218365,
      "text": "被称为天下第一晚万中宇宙三件国宝级的中国茶碗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00076",
      "start_ms": 218780,
      "end_ms": 219975,
      "text": "一件都没回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00077",
      "start_ms": 220270,
      "end_ms": 222705,
      "text": "您说这是收藏还是占友？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00078",
      "start_ms": 223440,
      "end_ms": 223985,
      "text": "第二名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00079",
      "start_ms": 224490,
      "end_ms": 225585,
      "text": "女史贞图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00080",
      "start_ms": 225960,
      "end_ms": 229565,
      "text": "东晋顾恺之画的原作早就没了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00081",
      "start_ms": 230390,
      "end_ms": 232175,
      "text": "现存的唐代模本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00082",
      "start_ms": 232570,
      "end_ms": 234625,
      "text": "是大英博物馆的镇馆之宝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00083",
      "start_ms": 236270,
      "end_ms": 237290,
      "text": "一九零零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00084",
      "start_ms": 237390,
      "end_ms": 238625,
      "text": "八国联军侵华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00085",
      "start_ms": 239170,
      "end_ms": 241915,
      "text": "一个英国上尉从北京把他带走了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00086",
      "start_ms": 242650,
      "end_ms": 243690,
      "text": "一九零三年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00087",
      "start_ms": 243890,
      "end_ms": 247285,
      "text": "大英博物馆只花了二十五英镑就买下了它。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00088",
      "start_ms": 247880,
      "end_ms": 249180,
      "text": "更让人心疼的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00089",
      "start_ms": 249180,
      "end_ms": 253505,
      "text": "后来大英博物馆的修画师不懂中国手绢怎么装裱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00090",
      "start_ms": 254090,
      "end_ms": 256395,
      "text": "按照日本屏风化的办法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00091",
      "start_ms": 257020,
      "end_ms": 262545,
      "text": "把这幅一千多年前的古画硬生生切成了好几段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00092",
      "start_ms": 263110,
      "end_ms": 264845,
      "text": "装在了木板上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00093",
      "start_ms": 265200,
      "end_ms": 265895,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00094",
      "start_ms": 266250,
      "end_ms": 269515,
      "text": "一副完整的手卷被裁成三段，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00095",
      "start_ms": 269940,
      "end_ms": 271485,
      "text": "贴在三块板子上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00096",
      "start_ms": 271940,
      "end_ms": 273335,
      "text": "旁边还打了钉子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00097",
      "start_ms": 273520,
      "end_ms": 276845,
      "text": "一幅千年古画被剪碎了裱起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00098",
      "start_ms": 277280,
      "end_ms": 279165,
      "text": "这事您上哪说理去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00099",
      "start_ms": 279920,
      "end_ms": 281205,
      "text": "您听出来了没有？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00100",
      "start_ms": 281620,
      "end_ms": 290080,
      "text": "这五件文物没有一件是光靠值钱出名的昭陵六郡靠的是六匹马分。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00101",
      "start_ms": 290080,
      "end_ms": 292150,
      "text": "在两国东皇经眷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00102",
      "start_ms": 292150,
      "end_ms": 294025,
      "text": "靠的是一箱一箱被搬走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00103",
      "start_ms": 294890,
      "end_ms": 295810,
      "text": "要变天幕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00104",
      "start_ms": 295830,
      "end_ms": 297170,
      "text": "靠的是三件国宝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00105",
      "start_ms": 297210,
      "end_ms": 299810,
      "text": "全在日本女史贞图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00106",
      "start_ms": 300170,
      "end_ms": 302030,
      "text": "靠的是被切碎装扮，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00107",
      "start_ms": 303710,
      "end_ms": 305670,
      "text": "每一件文物的厉害之处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00108",
      "start_ms": 306090,
      "end_ms": 308250,
      "text": "不在于它值多少银子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00109",
      "start_ms": 309050,
      "end_ms": 310110,
      "text": "在它回不了家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00110",
      "start_ms": 311310,
      "end_ms": 312850,
      "text": "我最近翻了一本书，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00111",
      "start_ms": 313790,
      "end_ms": 315430,
      "text": "叫人一生要看的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00112",
      "start_ms": 315570,
      "end_ms": 320510,
      "text": "一百个博物馆里头精选了全球一百个顶级博物馆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00113",
      "start_ms": 321230,
      "end_ms": 322210,
      "text": "每个馆里有什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00114",
      "start_ms": 322210,
      "end_ms": 324375,
      "text": "中国文物哪一年出去的？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00115",
      "start_ms": 324620,
      "end_ms": 327360,
      "text": "现在摆在哪个展厅写的清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00116",
      "start_ms": 327680,
      "end_ms": 330300,
      "text": "大英博物馆两万三千多件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00117",
      "start_ms": 330920,
      "end_ms": 332940,
      "text": "法国集美两万多件，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00118",
      "start_ms": 333480,
      "end_ms": 335680,
      "text": "美国大都会三万多件。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00119",
      "start_ms": 336660,
      "end_ms": 339880,
      "text": "咱们上级下集讲的这些书里都有，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00120",
      "start_ms": 340360,
      "end_ms": 344280,
      "text": "您可以带着孩子一页一页翻翻到哪儿。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00121",
      "start_ms": 344280,
      "end_ms": 348840,
      "text": "讲到哪告诉他这件是咱们的那件也是咱们的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00122",
      "start_ms": 348960,
      "end_ms": 350640,
      "text": "他们是怎么离开家的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00123",
      "start_ms": 350780,
      "end_ms": 352380,
      "text": "将来要靠谁接回来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00124",
      "start_ms": 352520,
      "end_ms": 353480,
      "text": "什么叫爱国？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00125",
      "start_ms": 353480,
      "end_ms": 356075,
      "text": "爱国不是喊出来的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00126",
      "start_ms": 356340,
      "end_ms": 358460,
      "text": "是让孩子知道自己从哪儿来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00127",
      "start_ms": 358800,
      "end_ms": 360135,
      "text": "家里丢过什么，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00128",
      "start_ms": 360390,
      "end_ms": 361805,
      "text": "以后要争回什么。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00129",
      "start_ms": 362830,
      "end_ms": 364885,
      "text": "这本书放在主页橱窗了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00130",
      "start_ms": 365300,
      "end_ms": 370185,
      "text": "点开头像就能看到中老年朋友看这种书最合适。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00131",
      "start_ms": 370740,
      "end_ms": 374505,
      "text": "图多四大不费眼睛放床头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00132",
      "start_ms": 374860,
      "end_ms": 375705,
      "text": "放茶几，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00133",
      "start_ms": 376210,
      "end_ms": 378665,
      "text": "随手翻一页就是一段历史。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00134",
      "start_ms": 379250,
      "end_ms": 379795,
      "text": "第一名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00135",
      "start_ms": 380170,
      "end_ms": 386840,
      "text": "敦煌莫高窟壁画前面说的藏经洞抢走的是经卷和卷画可，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00136",
      "start_ms": 386840,
      "end_ms": 390205,
      "text": "还有一样东西比经卷更让人心疼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00137",
      "start_ms": 390490,
      "end_ms": 392135,
      "text": "是画在墙上的画。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00138",
      "start_ms": 393090,
      "end_ms": 397725,
      "text": "莫高窟的壁画总面积四万五千多平方米，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00139",
      "start_ms": 398550,
      "end_ms": 402465,
      "text": "从十六国到元代画了一千多年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00140",
      "start_ms": 403380,
      "end_ms": 404545,
      "text": "可一百多年前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00141",
      "start_ms": 404870,
      "end_ms": 406315,
      "text": "西方探险家来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00142",
      "start_ms": 406740,
      "end_ms": 409375,
      "text": "用特制的胶布贴在墙上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00143",
      "start_ms": 409740,
      "end_ms": 412145,
      "text": "把壁画一块一块粘下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00144",
      "start_ms": 412440,
      "end_ms": 413135,
      "text": "运出境。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00145",
      "start_ms": 413520,
      "end_ms": 423520,
      "text": "现在大英博物馆、法国集美博物馆、俄罗斯埃尔米塔什博物馆、日本、美国到处都有敦煌壁画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00146",
      "start_ms": 423840,
      "end_ms": 425180,
      "text": "有的被切成方块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00147",
      "start_ms": 425400,
      "end_ms": 426720,
      "text": "有的被拼成整墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00148",
      "start_ms": 427080,
      "end_ms": 428680,
      "text": "有的整面墙被剥走。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00149",
      "start_ms": 428800,
      "end_ms": 429515,
      "text": "您想想，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00150",
      "start_ms": 429910,
      "end_ms": 432370,
      "text": "敦煌的墙是连着的画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00151",
      "start_ms": 432490,
      "end_ms": 434685,
      "text": "是连着画的一个故事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00152",
      "start_ms": 434960,
      "end_ms": 437005,
      "text": "从这面墙画到那面墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00153",
      "start_ms": 437410,
      "end_ms": 439250,
      "text": "现在被切开了一半，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00154",
      "start_ms": 439250,
      "end_ms": 439965,
      "text": "在伦敦，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00155",
      "start_ms": 440250,
      "end_ms": 441345,
      "text": "一半儿在巴黎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00156",
      "start_ms": 441850,
      "end_ms": 444110,
      "text": "一半在圣彼得堡丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00157",
      "start_ms": 444110,
      "end_ms": 446940,
      "text": "还能找回来墙上被剥走的画，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00158",
      "start_ms": 447160,
      "end_ms": 448205,
      "text": "怎么拼回去？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00159",
      "start_ms": 448570,
      "end_ms": 451115,
      "text": "您可以归还一件完整的文物，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00160",
      "start_ms": 451960,
      "end_ms": 453595,
      "text": "但你怎么归还一面墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00161",
      "start_ms": 454110,
      "end_ms": 456570,
      "text": "怎么归还一面被切成十几块，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00162",
      "start_ms": 456890,
      "end_ms": 458825,
      "text": "散落在四个国家的墙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00163",
      "start_ms": 459410,
      "end_ms": 462125,
      "text": "这才是中国流失文物最大的痛。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00164",
      "start_ms": 462610,
      "end_ms": 464410,
      "text": "不是某一件东西丢了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00165",
      "start_ms": 464470,
      "end_ms": 466795,
      "text": "是某一件东西被撕碎了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00166",
      "start_ms": 467090,
      "end_ms": 469865,
      "text": "圆明园被烧是一八六零年的事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00167",
      "start_ms": 470210,
      "end_ms": 472015,
      "text": "到今天一百六十多年了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00168",
      "start_ms": 472460,
      "end_ms": 475495,
      "text": "一百六十多年里有些文物回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00169",
      "start_ms": 475900,
      "end_ms": 476985,
      "text": "兽首回来了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00170",
      "start_ms": 477400,
      "end_ms": 478835,
      "text": "永乐大典回来过，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00171",
      "start_ms": 479710,
      "end_ms": 480875,
      "text": "可还有更多的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00172",
      "start_ms": 482070,
      "end_ms": 483505,
      "text": "在伦敦的玻璃柜里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00173",
      "start_ms": 484370,
      "end_ms": 485555,
      "text": "巴黎的库房里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00174",
      "start_ms": 486400,
      "end_ms": 487765,
      "text": "东京的展厅里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00175",
      "start_ms": 488700,
      "end_ms": 491575,
      "text": "某个英国乡下庄园的阁楼上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00176",
      "start_ms": 492450,
      "end_ms": 493535,
      "text": "他们不会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00177",
      "start_ms": 493970,
      "end_ms": 495485,
      "text": "但如果他们会说话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00178",
      "start_ms": 496420,
      "end_ms": 497525,
      "text": "一百六十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00179",
      "start_ms": 498420,
      "end_ms": 499815,
      "text": "他们只会说两个字，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00180",
      "start_ms": 500740,
      "end_ms": 501255,
      "text": "回家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00181",
      "start_ms": 502450,
      "end_ms": 505270,
      "text": "你觉得哪一件文物的故事最让你心疼？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00182",
      "start_ms": 505570,
      "end_ms": 508815,
      "text": "是被切成三段装版的女史真图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00183",
      "start_ms": 509380,
      "end_ms": 512680,
      "text": "还是那三件全在日本的药变天。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00184",
      "start_ms": 512680,
      "end_ms": 514625,
      "text": "木茶碗评论区聊聊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_0a693c094eb3ed78_s00185",
      "start_ms": 514880,
      "end_ms": 515325,
      "text": "我等你。"
    }
  ],
